Third-party components
================================================================================

This software depends on the following third-party packages (installed via
pip; each remains under its own license). This list is provided for
convenience — always verify against the package you actually install.

  Package            License (typical)     Notes
  -----------------  --------------------  --------------------------------
  PyQt5              GPL-3.0 / commercial  See the licensing note below
  Qt (via PyQt5)     LGPL-3.0 / GPL / commercial
  VTK                BSD-3-Clause          vtkmodules, 3D rendering
  NumPy              BSD-3-Clause
  SciPy              BSD-3-Clause
  pydicom            MIT                   DICOM parsing
  python-gdcm        BSD-style             JPEG-LS transfer syntax support
  onnxruntime        MIT                   AI model inference
  OpenCV             Apache-2.0            cv2
  Pillow             HPND-CMU              PIL
  openpyxl           MIT                   Excel export
  pypinyin           MIT                   Chinese pinyin (report QC)

Optional / referenced (not bundled in this repository):

  PaddleOCR (PP-OCRv4 ONNX models)  Apache-2.0
      Used by the report-QC OCR engine (reportqc/models/ocr/).

  Ultralytics YOLOv8 derived ONNX weights
      Model weights are not distributed with this repository; if you
      obtain weights trained with Ultralytics YOLOv8, review the
      AGPL-3.0 / commercial terms that apply to the training side.

